    "notes": "Based on the 2025 email. Appointment preview is fictional.",
    "subjectPart": "A friendly reminder: your {{eventName}} visit",
    "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>A friendly reminder: your {{eventName}} visit</title>\n<style>@media only screen and (max-width:620px){.shell{width:100%!important}.pad{padding-left:22px!important;padding-right:22px!important}.hero-title{font-size:32px!important} }</style></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#eee8de;color:#243c34;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all\">Keep your ticket handy. Here is everything you need for your visit.</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#eee8de\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 8px\">\n<!--[if mso]><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td><![endif]-->\n<table role=\"presentation\" class=\"shell\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#fffcf6\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"padding:26px 22px;border-top:6px solid #bd954a;background:#ffffff\"><a href=\"https://www.denversantaclausshop.org/\" style=\"display:inline-block\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/santas-workshop-193b5.appspot.com/public/dscs_logo_email.png\" width=\"250\" alt=\"Denver Santa Claus Shop, serving children since 1931\" style=\"display:block;width:250px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0 auto 14px\"></a><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#8e233c;font:bold italic 20px/1.4 Georgia,serif\">A Toy for Every Girl &amp; Boy</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#53645d\">A Denver holiday tradition · 2026</p></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"pad\" bgcolor=\"#8e233c\" style=\"padding:36px;color:#fff\"><p aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color:#edd49e;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:12px;margin:0 0 22px\">✦ &nbsp; ✦ &nbsp; ✦</p><h1 class=\"hero-title\" style=\"margin:0 0 24px;font:400 38px/1.15 Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;color:#fff\">Your visit is coming up.<br>Let’s get ready for joy.</h1><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold\">Hello {{firstName}},</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7\">We’re getting ready to welcome you to {{eventName}}. Here’s a friendly reminder of your appointment and what to bring.</p></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"padding:28px 36px;background:#155344;color:#fff\"><p style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;color:#edd49e;margin:0 0 10px\">YOUR APPOINTMENT</p><p style=\"font-size:23px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:bold\">{{dateTime}}</p><p style=\"font-size:13px;margin:0;color:#fff\">Denver time · Mountain Time</p></td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:28px 24px;background:#ffffff;border-bottom:2px dashed #ddccb3\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 14px;color:#155344;font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif\">Your holiday ticket</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7\">Show this QR code when you arrive. Keep the confirmation code below handy, too.</p><img src=\"{{qrCodeUrl}}\" width=\"432\" height=\"432\" alt=\"Your personal check-in QR code\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-width:432px;margin:20px auto;background:#fff;color:#243c34;font-size:14px\"><p style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;margin:12px 0 8px;color:#53645d\">CONFIRMATION CODE</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#8e233c;font:700 28px/1.4 'Courier New',monospace;letter-spacing:3px\">{{code}}</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"padding:32px 36px\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 14px;color:#155344;font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif\">Three things to bring</h2><ol style=\"padding-left:24px;margin:0 0 24px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.9\"><li>This ticket and QR code</li><li>Your photo ID</li><li>Proof of each child’s age</li></ol><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7\">Please arrive at your scheduled time. Need a different day or time? Update your registration in advance so we know when to welcome you.</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#155344\" style=\"border-radius:8px;text-align:center;mso-padding-alt:16px 24px\"><a href=\"https://register.denversantaclausshop.org/\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:16px 24px;border:1px solid #155344;border-radius:8px;color:#ffffff;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;line-height:1.4\">View or change registration</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"padding:28px 36px;background:#f6f0e6\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 14px;color:#155344;font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif\">Shop Venue</h2><p style=\"color:#7b2338;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.5\">DRAFT · CONFIRM 2026 DETAILS BEFORE PUBLISHING</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7\">Shop Venue — not yet confirmed for 2026:</p><p style=\"font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 12px\"><strong>South Lowry Marketplace</strong><br>7150 Leetsdale Drive, Unit 380<br>Denver, CO 80224</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7\">2026 opening date and time: TO BE CONFIRMED. Replace this note with the confirmed information before publishing.</p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=7150%20Leetsdale%20Drive%20Unit%20380%20Denver%20CO%2080224\" style=\"color:#155344;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.6\">View Shop Venue on map</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"padding:30px 36px\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 14px;color:#155344;font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif\">A question before your visit?</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7\">Our FAQs cover what to bring and how the Shop works. You can also contact us on Facebook.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:2;margin:0\"><a href=\"https://www.denversantaclausshop.org/faq-english/\" style=\"color:#8e233c;font-weight:bold\">Read the FAQs</a><br><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/denversantaclausshop/\" style=\"color:#155344\">Contact us on Facebook</a></p><p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;line-height:1.7;font-size:15px\">With warm wishes,<br><strong>Your Denver Santa Claus Shop volunteers</strong></p></td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px;border-top:1px solid #ddccb3;color:#53645d;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font:italic 16px/1.6 Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;color:#8e233c\">A little kindness. A little wonder. A season to remember.</p><a href=\"https://www.denversantaclausshop.org/\" style=\"color:#155344\">Our website</a><br>Denver Santa Claus Shop · 2026</td></tr>\n</table><!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "textPart": "Hello {{firstName}},\n\nWe’re getting ready to welcome you to {{eventName}}. Here’s a friendly reminder of your appointment and what to bring.\n\nYOUR APPOINTMENT\n{{dateTime}}\nDenver time · Mountain Time\n\nYour holiday ticket\nCONFIRMATION CODE: {{code}}\n{{qrCodeUrl}}\n\nThree things to bring\n- This ticket and QR code\n- Your photo ID\n- Proof of each child’s age\n\nPlease arrive at your scheduled time. Need a different day or time? Update your registration in advance so we know when to welcome you.\n\nView or change registration: https://register.denversantaclausshop.org/\n\nDRAFT · CONFIRM 2026 DETAILS BEFORE PUBLISHING\n\nShop Venue — not yet confirmed for 2026:\nSouth Lowry Marketplace\n7150 Leetsdale Drive, Unit 380\nDenver, CO 80224\n\n2026 opening date and time: TO BE CONFIRMED. Replace this note with the confirmed information before publishing.\n\nView Shop Venue on map: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=7150%20Leetsdale%20Drive%20Unit%20380%20Denver%20CO%2080224\n\nRead the FAQs: https://www.denversantaclausshop.org/faq-english/\n\nContact us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/denversantaclausshop/\n\nWith warm wishes,\nYour Denver Santa Claus Shop volunteers\n\nA Toy for Every Girl & Boy",
    "seasonalReviewRequired": true,
